#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:5
#: 04e10bb7be3d4d6192038959a9c1e62b
msgid "Connect ESCs and Motors"
msgstr "连接 ESC 和电机"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:7
#: 7b154baf702e49e18810d7750de62dbe
msgid ""
"This article explains how to connect the ESCs, motors and propellers to an "
"autopilot.  The Pixhawk is used as an example but other autopilots are "
"connected in a similar way."
msgstr "本文介绍如何将 ESC、电机和螺旋桨连接到飞控。以 Pixhawk 为例，其他飞控的连接方式类似。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:9
#: 918066e3401b49a8993bab12ee8d5836
msgid ""
"Connect the power (+), ground (-), and signal (s) wires for each ESC to the "
"autopilot's main output pins by motor number. Find your frame type below to "
"determine the assigned order of the motors."
msgstr "按电机编号将每个 ESC 的电源（+）、地线（-）和信号（s）线连接到飞控的主输出引脚。请根据下方的机架类型确定电机的分配顺序。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:16
#: 669f9d14d55f47e1ab7ebe4cce6cd0c5
msgid ""
"Pixhawk output pins (numbered). First 4 pins are colour-coded for connecting"
" a Quadframe"
msgstr "Pixhawk 输出引脚（带编号）。前 4 个引脚有颜色标识，用于连接四旋翼机架"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:19
#: ec8be441a2ac4434b876e602b8849f48
msgid "Motor order diagrams"
msgstr "电机顺序图"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:21
#: bcf988e1a0364c34a11edfb5f35c947a
msgid ""
"The diagrams below show motor order for each frame type. Propeller direction"
" is shown in green (clockwise, CW) or blue (counter-clockwise, CCW). The "
"letters shown in red indicate which motor should turn when using Mission "
"Planner's **Motor Test** feature found under its SETUP->Optional Hardware "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"下图显示了各机架类型的电机顺序。螺旋桨方向以绿色（顺时针，CW）或蓝色（逆时针，CCW）表示。红色字母表示使用 Mission Planner "
"**电机测试** 功能（位于 SETUP->Optional Hardware 选项卡下）时应旋转的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:28
