#: ../../source/docs/connect-escs-and-motors.rst:64
#: 4903e272be69458996b1750b6e5330dc
msgid ""
"Quad A Tail and V Tail frames do not use the front motors for yaw control "
"(NYT). The direction of motor rotation is not critical for basic operation, "
"but unless the front motors spin in opposite directions, roll and pitch "
"inputs will result in adverse yaw, resulting in less dynamic range of the "
"yaw control."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼 A 尾和 V "
"尾机架不使用前电机进行偏航控制（NYT）。电机旋转方向对于基本操作并非关键，但如果前电机不以相反方向旋转，横滚和俯仰输入将导致反向偏航，从而降低偏航控制的动态范围。"

