#: 0d1c4f616765401380dbcfe250f9d8a3
msgid ""
"Quad 'No Yaw Torque' (NYT) frames are primarily intended for :ref:`VTOL "
"Tailsitter<guide-tailsitter>` configurations with large control surfaces. "
"Motor rotation direction does not matter for these motors, but unless the "
"motor's spin directions are setup as any kind of normal QUAD frame, roll and"
" pitch inputs will result in adverse yaw, resulting in less dynamic range of"
" the yaw control of the fixed wing control surfaces."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼\"无偏航力矩\"（NYT）机架主要用于带有大控制面的 :ref:`VTOL 尾坐式飞行器<guide-tailsitter>` "
"配置。这些电机的旋转方向并不重要，但除非电机旋转方向设置为任何常规四旋翼机架的方式，否则横滚和俯仰输入将导致反向偏航，从而降低固定翼控制面的偏航控制动态范围。"

